// Shared build settings applied project-wide (see project.yml's top-level
// `configFiles:`). Currently just the one build-time-injected secret below,
// but this is the place for any future project-wide xcconfig value.

// Bearer key the official bridge's check_auth() requires on its legacy
// yt-dlp-backed routes (search/stream/download/track/resolve/spotify/
// playlist/lyrics/radio — see ios-bridge/main.py). Read into the app via
// each target's Info.plist ($(LUMISOUND_BRIDGE_API_KEY) -> LumisoundBridgeAPIKey)
// and from there via Bundle.main in StreamingService.swift / TVBridge.swift.
//
// Defaults to empty here (an app built with no override just sends no key,
// same as pointing at a self-hosted bridge with none configured). The real
// value is injected locally by including Secrets.xcconfig below, which is
// gitignored and never committed — see Secrets.xcconfig.example for setup.
// This keeps the actual secret out of source/git history entirely while
// still letting a real build embed it, since it has to ship in the compiled
// app either way.
LUMISOUND_BRIDGE_API_KEY =

#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
